Package: tncensus
Type: Package
Title: Harmonized Tunisian Census Data at the Delegation Level
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tunisian National Institute of Statistics", role = c("dtc", "cph"),
           comment = "Institut National de la Statistique (INS)"),
    person(given = "Mohamed Dhia",
           family = "Hammami",
           email = "mhammami@syr.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4498-8770"))
    )
Description: Provides harmonized delegation-level data from Tunisia's 2014 and
    2024 General Population and Housing Censuses (Recensement General de la
    Population et de l'Habitat, RGPH). Contains 45 socioeconomic indicators
    covering education, employment, infrastructure, housing, household
    equipment, and migration for 281 delegations nested in 24 governorates,
    with a geographic crosswalk resolving name changes between census waves.
    All variables are rescaled to a common 0-100 percentage metric.
    Includes a codebook, the delegation-level crosswalk,
    and a harmonization log documenting every matching and recoding decision.
